   "hypothesis_id": "H3",
   "mechanism": "DSP anchors intermediate filaments to desmosomes; less of it makes airway epithelium leakier and more migratory. FAM13A modulates beta-catenin turnover in the same tissue. Together they shift epithelium towards a mesenchymal, Wnt-active state, so the epithelium stops being a barrier and starts being a source of profibrotic signal. This is a distinct compartment from H2: airway, not alveolus.",
